        <mxCell id="legend_box" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda de Papéis Arquiteturais (Laravel Modular):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;font-size:11px; margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#DAE8FC; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Controller&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#D5E8D4; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFE6CC; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Repository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#E1D5E7; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DTO / Request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFF2CC; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resource&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F5F5F5; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Entity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F8CECC; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Interface&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="770" width="1970" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_impl_tutor" value="&lt;b&gt;Regras de Implementação da Área D (Tutor de IA e Analytics):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Streaming e Latência:&lt;/b&gt; TutorController utiliza SSE (Server-Sent Events) para streaming de resposta em menos de 3s (RNF003) e gerencia compra de créditos extras (RF020, RNF022).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Cota e Rate Limiting:&lt;/b&gt; TutorService valida cota no Redis (20 msg/hora em janela deslizante via TutorRateLimiter). Esgotada a cota, consome pacote extra (TutorCreditPack); se ausente, HTTP 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS com Retry-After (D-cota, D-cota-extra).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Integração RAG e Contexto:&lt;/b&gt; CourseTutorClient consome o microsserviço ai-service (PostgreSQL pgvector) enviando contexto da aula e timestamp opcional do vídeo (D6) com respeito ao locale do usuário (RNF013).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Analytics com Isolamento:&lt;/b&gt; DashboardController recebe parâmetros em inglês: startDate, endDate, courseId e groupBy (day, week, month) (D3); DashboardAnalyticsService aplica restrição do Instrutor (UC007 R-2, 403 FORBIDDEN se consultar curso alheio).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tratamento de Erros:&lt;/b&gt; Exceções (403 FORBIDDEN, 404 NOT_FOUND, 409 LESSON_NOT_INDEXED, 422 VALIDATION_FAILED, 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS) seguem ApiException do TDD 3.1; não são modeladas como classes." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="825" width="1970" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
